        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "In its operation of the business, management, including our chief operating decision maker (“CODM”), who is also our Chief Executive Officer, reviews certain financial information, including segmented internal profit and loss statements. The primary profitability measure used by the CODM to review segment operating results is operating income. The CODM uses operating income to allocate resources during our annual planning process and throughout the year, as well as to assess the performance of our segments, primarily by monitoring actual results compared to prior periods and expected results. During the periods presented, we reported our financial performance based on the following segments: Productivity and Business Processes, Intelligent Cloud, and More Personal Computing.",
      "text_hash": "efcd150c810bc715a97d3e59da4d44ef059f51e0a0d38a40339c8115ccfe851c",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-001182-b3eedf85",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[246]/div[2]/ix:nonnumeric/p[3]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 1182,
      "reported_page": 82,
      "source_anchor": "F_7f967ae4-814d-466a-a8e1-584a8795d9c6_2",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "We have recast certain prior period amounts to conform to the way we internally manage and monitor our business. Refer to Note 1 – Accounting Policies for further information.",
      "text_hash": "b3eedf85b83657382fbf26fd50e029ba4d5aad257e880c636fb772135ab5cd43",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-001183-352d4c96",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[246]/div[2]/ix:nonnumeric/p[4]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 1183,
      "reported_page": 82,
      "source_anchor": "F_7f967ae4-814d-466a-a8e1-584a8795d9c6_2",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "times new roman"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "9pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our reportable segments are described below.",
      "text_hash": "352d4c9695094536bfaee575b0ea75367d93f89b434e0a8256c31abc3d9ce269",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-001184-94a2e06c",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[246]/div[2]/ix:nonnumeric/p[5]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 1184,
      "reported_page": 82,
      "source_anchor": "F_7f967ae4-814d-466a-a8e1-584a8795d9c6_2",
